      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if it's strength though. it just feels like i'm being forced to endure something i didn't ask for. the doctors, the pills, the slow decline... it's all just happening *to* me. i have no say in any of it. i just wish i had some kind of control over how this all finishes.",
